fold_input.description:
An AlphaFold 3 fold-input JSON, as text. Example:
{"name": "x", "dialect": "alphafold3", "version": 2, "sequences": [{"protein": {"id": "A", "sequence": "MKTAYIAKQRQ...", "modifications": [], "templates": [], "unpairedMsa": ">query\nMKTAYIAKQRQ...\n", "pairedMsa": ""}}], "modelSeeds": [1]}
modelSeeds chooses the sampler seeds; one prediction runs per seed. unpairedMsa may be the query alone for a single-sequence prediction, but accuracy is much lower than with a real MSA.
